<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Subscription Expiration Notice &mdash; Delivery Team</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f5;
      padding: 40px;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    "
  >
    <div
      style="
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      "
    >
      <!-- Header -->
      <div
        style="
          background-color: #008ed3;
          padding: 28px 32px;
          text-align: center;
        "
      >
        <div
          style="
            background-color: #ffffff;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
          "
        >
          <img
            src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2FC2C.png?alt=media&token=2c05d23e-1974-4a83-8143-99c1b6b96801"
            alt="CVtoCAREER Logo"
            style="display: block; width: 149px; height: 32px"
          />
        </div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 22px">
          Subscription Expiration Notice
        </h1>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #d0eaf9; font-size: 13px">
          CVtoCAREER &mdash; Delivery Team Notification
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Body -->
      <div style="padding: 28px 32px">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 16px">Hi team,</p>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 16px">
          The <strong><%= noticeLabel %></strong> expiration notice for the
          following client has just fired automatically &mdash; the journey step
          has been recorded and the renewal reminder email has gone out to the
          client.
        </p>

        <div
          style="
            background-color: #f0f7fc;
            border-left: 4px solid #008ed3;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 20px 0;
          "
        >
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: #333">
            <strong>Client:</strong> <%= clientName %>
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: #333">
            <strong>Email:</strong> <%= clientEmail %>
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: #333">
            <strong>Plan:</strong> <%= plan %>
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: #333">
            <strong>Expires:</strong> <%= expiresOn %>
            (<%= daysRemaining %> day<%= daysRemaining === 1 ? "" : "s" %>)
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0 8px">
          <a
            href="<%= link %>"
            style="
              background-color: #008ed3;
              color: #fff;
              text-decoration: none;
              font-weight: bold;
              padding: 12px 32px;
              border-radius: 6px;
              display: inline-block;
              font-size: 14px;
            "
          >
            Open client profile &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px">
          &mdash; CVtoCAREER System
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div
        style="
          padding: 16px 32px;
          background-color: #f9fafb;
          border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
          text-align: center;
        "
      >
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af">
          &copy; <%= currentYear %> CVtoCAREER. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
